rder IDs and\nconfirm signed ",[297,841,842],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[297,845,846],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[816,849,850],{},"Check duplicate and failed deliveries. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing the tunnel; record any resources you create.",[293,852,853,856,857,860,861,456,864,860,867,860,870,873,874,877,878,881],{},[297,854,855],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[297,858,859],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[297,862,863],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[297,865,866],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[297,868,869],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[297,871,872],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[297,875,876],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[297,879,880],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". These mutate account data.\nUse them only with permission and disposable test resources, not existing\nsubscriptions or orders just because the key is in test mode.",[786,883,885],{"id":884},"run-this-packages-checks","Run this package's checks",[302,887,891],{"className":888,"code":889,"language":890,"meta":307,"style":307},"language-sh shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm check\n","sh",[297,892,893,905],{"__ignoreMap":307},[311,894,895,899,902],{"class":313,"line":314},[311,896,898],{"class":897},"sBMFI","pnpm",[311,900,901],{"class":338}," install",[311,903,904],{"class":338}," --frozen-lockfile\n",[311,906,907,909],{"class":313,"line":348},[311,908,898],{"class":897},[311,910,911],{"class":338}," check\n",[293,913,914],{},"For edge hosts, also run your app in the local edge runtime with its storage adapter.\nNode tests alone do not check edge compatibility.",[293,916,917,918,924,925,530],{},"See the ",[794,919,923],{"href":920,"rel":921},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fguides\u002Ftesting",[922],"nofollow","testing guide"," and\n",[794,926,929],{"href":927,"rel":928},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Ftest-helpers",[922],"Test Helpers API reference",[